  "qualified_claim": "For the four frozen O14 pre-cap ponded profiles under the frozen 1 cm surface cap, 12*KSAT supply and -15 cm bottom head, one transactional constrained cap-event corrector from the original committed state can be composed directly with the already-qualified 40-step Ross post-cap runoff continuation. Candidate and independent reference agree far inside all frozen event, post-cap and whole-path accuracy gates, the surface-cap transfer is mass conservative, runoff remains an explicit result/runtime ledger, rejected event trials do not publish state or runoff, and post-cap qtop is recomputed from the accepted cap state rather than reused from before the event.",
